return ['domain'=>'zinn-reseller','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'zinn-reseller','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-02T07:33:56+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-02T07:33:56+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Reseller Toolkit'=>'Zinn® Reseller Toolkit','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller','Sell Zinn Digital® hosting from your own WordPress site — footprint-free PBN, WordPress, WooCommerce, agency, reseller, cloud and VPS hosting. Search and offer domains from your reseller account, sign your clients straight into their hosting panel, and provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order is paid.'=>'Ta hosting Zinn Digital® lati aaye WordPress tirẹ — PBN ti ko ni footprint, WordPress, WooCommerce, ile-iṣẹ, olutaja (reseller), awọsanma (cloud) ati hosting VPS. Wa ati funni ni awọn agbegbe (domains) lati inu akọọlẹ olutaja rẹ, wọ awọn alabara rẹ taara sinu nronu hosting wọn, ati pese hosting laifọwọyi nigbati a ba san owo aṣẹ WooCommerce kan.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','The hosting platform answered with status %d.'=>'Pẹpẹ agbalejo naa dahun pẹlu ipo %d.','Find your domain name'=>'Wá orúkọ ìdánimọ̀ rẹ','Search'=>'Wá a','No extensions were checked for that name.'=>'A kò ṣàyẹ̀wò àwọn ìfikún èyíkéyìí fún orúkọ yẹn.','Domain search is unavailable on this site at the moment.'=>'Àwárí agbègbè kò sí lórí ojú-òpẹ́ yìí fúngbà díẹ̀.','We could not reach the domain registry just now. Please try again in a moment.'=>'Àwa kò lè dé ọ̀dọ̀ ìforíkọ́lu ìtumọ̀ domain ní àkìsí yìí. Jọ̀wọ́ gbiyanjú lẹ́kan síwájú ní ìṣẹ́jú kan.','The API key is missing or no longer valid. Check it under Settings → Zinn® Reseller.'=>'Kò sí bọ́tìnnì API tàbí ó ti di aláìnílari mọ́. Ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀ lábẹ́ Ètò → Zinn® Reseller.','This API key does not carry the sites.view permission, which the domain search needs. Add it to the key in your reseller panel, or clear the key here to fall back to the public search.'=>'Bọtìlì API yii ko ni igbanilaaye sites.view, eyiti wiwa agbegbe nilo. Fi kun bọtìlì naa ninu igbimọ oniṣowo rẹ, tabi mu bọtìlì naa kuro nibi lati pada si wiwa ti gbogbo eniyan.','Only administrators see this:'=>'Àwọn aláṣẹ nìkan ló lè rí èyí:','We could not check this one — try again'=>'A kò lè ṣàyẹ̀wò èyí – gbiyanju lẹ́ẹ̀kan si','Already registered'=>'Ti forukọ silẹ tẹlẹ','Available — ask us for a price'=>'Ó wà — béèrè iye owó lọ́wọ́ wa','Available — %1$s %2$s for the first year'=>'O wa — %1$s %2$s fún ọdún akọkọ','Register it'=>'Forukọ silẹ','Manage my hosting'=>'Ṣàkóso ìgbékalẹ̀ wẹ́bù mi','Please sign in first.'=>'Jọwọ wọlé kọkọ.','This account is not linked to a hosting service yet.'=>'Ko tii si àkọọlẹ yi ti a so mọ iṣẹ ìgbékalẹ wẹẹbu kan sí.','The hosting platform did not return a sign-in link.'=>'Pẹpẹ ìgbalejo náà kò dá ìjápọ̀ wọlé sílẹ̀.','Zinn® Reseller'=>'Olùtajà Zinn®','Settings'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀rọ̀','Connect this site to your Zinn® reseller account, then switch on only the parts you need.'=>'So pọ site yii pọ mọ akọọlẹ alabojuto Zinn® rẹ, lẹhinna tan awọn apakan nikan ti o nilo.','API key'=>'Bọtínì API','Create one in your Zinn® dashboard under API keys. Give it only the permissions the modules below need.'=>'Ṣẹda ọkan ninu dasibodu Zinn® rẹ labẹ awọn bọtini API. Fun ni awọn igo nikan ti awọn module ni isalẹ nilo.','API address'=>'Adirẹsi API','Panel address'=>'Àdéésì pánẹ̀lì','Where your clients are sent to manage their hosting. If you have set a panel hostname under Reselling → Your brand, put it here — your clients then never see our address at all.'=>'Ibikùn tẹ́ a máa ́n rán àwọn oníbàárà rẹ sí láti ṣàkóso gbígbéṣọ̀ yín. Tí o bá ti ṣètò orúkọ olùgbàlejò nínú Ìtajà títún → Àmì ìṣòwò rẹ, fi síbí — àwọn oníbàárà rẹ kì yóò rí àdírẹ́sì wa rárá lẹ́yìn náà.','Modules'=>'Àwọn móduùlù','Domain search — the [zinn_domain_search] shortcode, priced from your own domain account.'=>'Àwárí agbègbè wẹ́bù — kúkúrú kódù [zinn_domain_search], pẹ̀lú iye owó láti inú àkọọ̀sẹ̀ agbègbè wẹ́bù rẹ.','Panel link — the [zinn_panel_link] shortcode signs a logged-in client into their hosting.'=>'Ọna asopọ igbimọ — koodu kukuru [zinn_panel_link] n wọle si alabara ti o ti wọle si ile-iṣẹ agbalejo wọn.','WooCommerce — provision hosting automatically when an order is paid.'=>'WooCommerce — pèsè ìgbàlejò lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀ nígbà tí wọ́n bá san owó àṣẹ rẹ̀.','WooCommerce is not active on this site, so this module is doing nothing.'=>'WooCommerce kò ṣiṣẹ lori aaye yii, nitorinaa module yii ko ṣe nkan kankan.','Default plan code'=>'Koodu ètò àiyọ̀ǹtán','Used for a WooCommerce product that does not name its own plan. Set the per-product plan on the product itself under Inventory.'=>'Lo fun ọja WooCommerce kan ti ko sọ orukọ ètò tirẹ. Ṣeto ètò fun ọja kọọkan lori ọja naa funrarẹ labẹ Ohun-ini (Inventory).','Connection'=>'Ìsopọ̀','No API key yet, so nothing is connected.'=>'Kò tíì sí bọ́tìnnì API kankan, nítorí náà kò sí ohun tí a ti sopọ̀.','Not connected: %s'=>'Ko sopọ: %s','Connected. Your reseller programme is %s.'=>'A ti sopọ. Eto olutaja rẹ jẹ %s.','No Zinn® API key is configured, so nothing was provisioned.'=>'Ko si bọtini API Zinn® kan ti a tunto, nitorina ko si ohun ti a pese.','This order did not include a domain name, so there was nothing to provision.'=>'Àṣẹ yìí kò ní orúkọ agbègbè kankan nínú, nítorí náà kò sí ohun tí a lè pèsè.','The hosting platform did not return a site.'=>'Pẹpẹ ìgbalejo náà kò dá ojula kan padà.','Zinn® hosting provisioned for %1$s (service %2$s).'=>'Ìpèsè ohun èlò ayélujára Zinn® fún %1$s (iṣẹ́ %2$s).','The hosting platform did not return a client account.'=>'Pẹpẹ gbigiho ko pada si akọọlẹ alabara kan.','Zinn® hosting was NOT provisioned: %s'=>'Àì ṣe ìdàgbàsו́kì ìgbalejò Zinn®: %s','Zinn® product line'=>'Ìlà ọjà Zinn®','The Zinn® product line to provision when this product is bought. Leave blank to use the default from the plugin settings.'=>'Laini ọja Zinn® lati pèsè nigbati o ra ọja yii. Fi silẹ ni ṣofo lati lo aiyipada lati awọn eto afikun.','Zinn® hosting'=>'Gbigi Zinn®','Service id'=>'Àmì iṣẹ́ ìránṣẹ́','Nothing provisioned for this order.'=>'Kò sí ohunkohun tí a pèsè fẹ́lẹ̀ṣẹ́ fún ìbéèrè yìí.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — awọn amọna ati awọn iṣẹ','User guides'=>'Awọn itọnisọna olumulo','Read the %s user guide'=>'Ka itọsọna olumulo %s','Hide this'=>'Fi eyi pamọ','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Ìgbàlejò Zinn® fún WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, àwọn àfẹ́hìntì lójoojúmọ́, ìṣípòpadà ọ̀fẹ́ àti ìṣàkóso tó ṣeé lò fún àwọn èèyàn tó ń darí ju ojú-wọ̀n kan lọ.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Ọjà Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Ra ati ta awọn aaye, awọn agbegbe ati awọn ibi ti a ti n gbe awọn ọna asopọ kalẹ ti o ti fi idi mulẹ, lak ti o ti n tọju owo naa ni aabo titi ti awọn ẹgbẹ mejeeji yoo fi ni itẹlọrun.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — bẹ gba awọn eniyan ti o ṣe eyi fun igbesi aye kan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Ọjà àwọn oníṣẹ́ọwọ́ káríayé wa: ṣíwò fún àwọn iṣẹ́ tó ti ṣetan jẹ́jẹ́ tó lé ní 10,000 láti ọ̀dọ̀ àwọn ònkọ̀wé, apẹ̀rẹ̀, àwọn olùṣẹ̀dá sọfitiwia àti àwọn olùgbéga SEO, tàbí kí o fi iṣẹ́ kan sórí afẹ́fẹ́ kí o sì jẹ́ kí wọ́n fún ní iye owó.']];